              <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div class="details" id="answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-4" hidden>
            <p>
              Scoop at least once a day and fully refresh the box on a regular schedule. A clean box helps cats feel safe and reduces accidents.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <h2>
            <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-5" id="question-5">
